<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $2.00-2.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $2.00-2.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Tuesday, were $2.00 to mostly $2.50 lower. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	  220-250 lbs    49.50, few 50.00</p>
<p>			250-260 lbs    49.00-49.50</p>
<p>			260-270 lbs    48.00-59.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	  270-280 lbs    47.00-48.00</p>
<p>    US 2-4	  280-290 lbs    46.00-47.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4	  290-300 lbs    45.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - weak/off $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    43.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    45.00-46.00, late 45.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    46.00-48.00, late 46.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    49.00-51.00, late 49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
